WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.290
The Sun is a vast ball of hot gas.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:07.730
Its own gravity pulls every part
of it inwards, all the time.

3
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.510
Yet it isn't collapsing.

4
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.590
It has shone steadily
for billions of years.

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.570
So what is holding it up?

6
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.910
And what happens when that stops?

7
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.590
In this mission, you'll find out
how nuclear fusion of hydrogen

8
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.450
in a star's core releases
enormous amounts of energy.

9
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.170
Then you'll follow a
star forward in time,

10
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.670
to see where its story leads.

11
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.510
Your mission: find out
what holds a star up,

12
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.650
and what happens next.
